67492675781, 599.0691528320312], "pos": [-1211.47412109375, 2418.232421875], "widgets_values": ["Create a photorealistic high-definition vertical 9:16 ancient-style portrait with the theme of serving tea in a stone bridge beside a moonlit water alley. Show one clearly adult East Asian woman with refined enduring features, a soft face, bright clear eyes, fair natural skin texture, and a pure gentle temperament. She looks directly into the lens as if looking softly at the viewer. She wears a moon-white, cream-white, or pale blue-white silk-satin ancient-style dress with real folds, delicate flower-branch embroidery, and flowing cuffs. Her black hair is in a semi-updo with loose strands, a slight night breeze, and restrained white floral, pearl, or jade hair ornaments. Use a high-angle first-person POV close interactive composition: she holds a complete teapot, teacup, or tea bowl up toward the lens near the viewer's eye level; the tea set is in the foreground and her clearly visible face is behind and slightly above it, creating the layered relationship of tea in front and person behind. The action is serving tea, with correctly proportioned spout, handle, cup mouth, natural liquid direction, slender natural fingers, and an elegant gentle gesture. Build a stone bridge beside a moonlit water alley with water reflections, warm lanterns, ancient architecture, night channels, and only a few softly blurred tourists. Mix cool blue night ambience with warm yellow practical lights, moderate background blur, natural lens depth, and soft night shadows. Emphasize the feeling that she is presenting tea directly to the viewer, not a static standing shot. Avoid underage or childlike styling, seductive provocation, flat expression, malformed fingers, distorted tea ware, wrong liquid direction, broken clothing, exaggerated anatomy, plastic skin, greasy face, warped background, watermarks, logos, text, low resolution, cartoon style, and CGI appearance.", "edit", "auto", "auto", false,